    "finalMessage": "Built the debit card controls screen at `src/screens/Screen.tsx` with styles in `src/screens/Screen.module.css`.\n\n- **Card** header shows an `IconTile`, the card name and masked last four digits, with a status `Badge` (Active/Frozen, dot + words + icon when frozen).\n- **Freeze** is a `Switch`; when on, an `Alert` (`live=\"polite\"`) explains the other controls don't apply, and the online payments, contactless and international `Switch` rows plus the daily-limit `Slider` all get `isDisabled`.\n- **Daily spending limit** uses a `Slider` with `formatOptions` for currency, showing the live value.\n- Layout uses CSS module classes only, logical properties (`inline-size`, `padding-block`, etc.), token variables, and wrapping flex rows so nothing overflows at 390px.\n\n`audit_snippet` scored both files 100/0 findings. I couldn't run the dev server per your instructions, so this hasn't been visually verified in a browser."
